{"synopsis":"Min-su Lee adalah pemimpin tim ESG di konglomerat besar Soya Group. Wajahnya selalu datar, hidupnya sederhana, dan prinsipnya cuma satu: “Kerja boleh ribet, tapi pulang harus tepat waktu!”\n\nSayangnya, kedamaian itu buyar begitu Kang Chae-eun, putri bungsu sang ketua perusahaan, tiba-tiba masuk ke timnya. Sejak hari pertama, suasana jadi heboh—mulai dari drama politik kantor, rekan kerja tukang cari muka, sampai bos-bos yang hobi bikin masalah.\n\nTanpa mau, Min-su terseret ke pusaran intrik kantor yang absurd. Tapi di balik semua itu, tekadnya tetap sama:pulang kerja tepat waktu.\n\nApakah Min-su bisa mempertahankan mimpi sucinya untuk pulang kerja tepat waktu? Atau malah terjebak selamanya dalam drama kantor yang penuh gila-gilaan?","alternative_title":"오늘도 퇴근","author":"Parsher, White Grass","artist":"Underwater","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7c8c4b83-dd32-4766-bc0b-0a0e46b9d8b1","number":"52","chapter":"52","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29"},{"chapter_id":"c983af50-9908-48f0-ba80-0399211ce100","number":"51","chapter":"51","title":"","date":"2026-07-23","released":"2026-07-23"},{"chapter_id":"fa576bdd-f327-47ef-980e-d9dc2cc59556","number":"50","chapter":"50","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"ba60a2b2-ff3a-4059-92ea-33ff759b9177","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-07-16","released":"2026-07-16"},{"chapter_id":"31b9c159-552a-4c1b-b413-136308513753","number":"48","chapter":"48","title":"","date":"2026-07-09","released":"2026-07-09"},{"chapter_id":"41900cbb-c12f-4d72-883c-1df38f497ae6","number":"47","chapter":"47","title":"","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23"},{"chapter_id":"1234aa26-bc0d-4026-be98-3540ab53f702","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"b4f65bb2-14e8-4d98-a529-4a441c07e1dd","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-06-10","released":"2026-06-10"},{"chapter_id":"e9c20f7d-0c64-4ced-912c-c29